process: YuanShen
title: YuanShen
y @ Media play/pause: key MediaPlayPause norepeat
dpad left @ Left: key left
dpad right @ Right: key right
dpad up @ Up: key up
dpad down @ Down: key down
left shoulder @ Media previous track: key MediaPreviousTrack norepeat
right shoulder @ Media next track: key MediaNextTrack norepeat
left thumb @ Show Virtual Keyboard: virtualkeyboard show
right thumb @ Middle mouse button: mouse middle
left trigger @ Ctrl: key lcontrolkey norepeat
right trigger @ Shift: key lshiftkey norepeat
backbutton @ Use Secondary Bindings: modifier back
back guide @ Turn off controller: cmd turnOffController
back a @ Display second screen only: cmd process displayswitch.exe /external
back y @ Display PC screen only: cmd process displayswitch.exe /internal
back x @ Minimize all windows: cmd keyCombo LWin M
back right shoulder @ Open Task Switcher (Ctrl+Alt+Tab): cmd keyCombo LControlKey LMenu Tab
back dpad up @ Volume up: key VolumeUp
back dpad down @ Volume down: key VolumeDown
back b @ Escape: key escape norepeat
back right thumb @ Toggle help: cmd togglehelp
back x @ Open Task Switcher (Ctrl+Alt+Tab): cmd keyCombo LControlKey LMenu Tab
right thumb @ Open Task Switcher (Ctrl+Alt+Tab): cmd keyCombo LControlKey LMenu Tab
back left shoulder @ Alt+f: key LMenu+F norepeat
right shoulder @ Enter: key Return norepeat
left shoulder @ Ctrl （重复）: key LControlKey
back dpad left @ F2: key F2 norepeat
back dpad right @ F3: key F3 norepeat
back left trigger @ Win+Shift+Left: key LWin+LShiftKey+Left norepeat
back right trigger @ Win+Shift+Right: key LShiftKey+LWin+Right norepeat
right trigger @ Right: key Right norepeat
left trigger @ Left: key Left norepeat
back b @ Ctrl+c: key LControlKey+C norepeat
back a @ Ctrl+v: key LControlKey+V norepeat
back right thumb @ F5: key F5 norepeat
back y @ Display second screen only: cmd process displayswitch.exe /external
left stick @ WSAD keys: key W S A D norepeat
right stick @ Mouse movement: mouse movement
b @ Left mouse button: mouse left
a @ Right mouse button: mouse right
x @ f: key F norepeat
start @ Space （重复）: key Space
guide @ Ctrl+q: key LControlKey+Q norepeat
